{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一連三場，許志安《On Stage演唱會》今日（10/10）舉行尾場，最後一場嘉賓有「四大天王」的張學友，二人合唱了《一家一減你》及《我應該》。張學友</p><p>一連三場，許志安《On Stage演唱會》今日（10/10）舉行尾場，最後一場嘉賓有「四大天王」的張學友，二人</p><p>合唱了《一家一減你》及《我應該》。</p><p>張學友上到台便投訴自己都買不到飛，「我話我喎！但做嘉賓就有4張，所以好開心！」最後張學友再追問安仔點解今次開得三場？「如果係回應第一次紅館都係開三場嘅話，冇乜必要囉！」</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714338250625024984612.jpeg/wvcN7A1TYNW-uBEdA1bATJFOOcdnn7oRHAMZcyYDGXM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714335343841280593170.jpeg/R9o9xmQmE2zTlT35ZzuDigwEDPKR1xjgupz3PICc9zw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714332030210048463719.jpeg/jER1FnHdz-RVgvmMbk7AKkgdCl6NNITUJQerPx8Hqz8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714343527321600091647.jpeg/6Q9ovUGuiMhfdueNkGVOwjKNP-dSgQm0VWNBxm9jQcY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714340817670144068745.jpeg/oyIqquO3diioZuanLFEchpOGILferXmTru42xpTuNsY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714337990578176613754.jpeg/pC3s94_5W0lLo9m_vPIF5SEr6AB0mUjZXQRd32cEXd8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714335150903296152064.jpeg/2aalIz4YQk2DuFz8Jd6Bfvv7qZuVCc00btJ9r1TSfa8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185714332357365760091325.jpeg/4BWcDLiSUU156zlig7Wae5KWb11d5HNYn8XWk6XF1pM\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T14:38:14.358743+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}